# [BESS](../wg/bess.html)

## Summary

The BGP Enabled ServiceS (BESS) Working Group met at IETF 127. The session was chaired by Matthew Bocci, with co-chairs Jeffrey Zhang and Stephane Litkowski participating online. Minutes were taken by Krishna Swamy. 

The meeting covered standard working group document updates, followed by technical presentations and discussions on EVPN L3 multi-homing, assisted replication for SRv6, EVPN anycast multihoming, multicast router state synchronization, EVPN subnet slicing, group policy extensions, multicast multihoming convergence, and IPFIX export of BGP VPN information.

