### EVPN Multi-Homing Support for L3 Services
* **Presenter:** Patrice Brissette
* **Slide Deck:** [L3 Multi-homing update](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-bess-l3-multi-homing-update-00)
* **Draft:** [`draft-ietf-bess-evpn-l3mh-proto`](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-bess-evpn-l3mh-proto)
* **Discussion:**
  * Patrice presented an update on EVPN multi-homing procedures for L3 interfaces. Updates explicitly clarify route encodings: options to include the IP VRF along with the route, or use the ESI plus EVI Route Targets.
  * Clarified the label field usage in Route Type 2 (carrying MPLS labels or VNIs in label 2) to maintain backward compatibility with existing implementations.
  * Multiple implementations (including SONiC and Cisco XR) exist.

