### EVPN Multicast Router State Synchronization
* **Presenter:** Jorge Rabadan
* **Slide Deck:** [ietf127-bess-evpn-mcast-router-sync-01](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-bess-ietf127-bess-evpn-mcast-router-sync-01-00)
* **Draft:** `draft-ietf-bess-evpn-mcast-router-sync`
* **Discussion:**
  * Defines mechanisms to synchronize multicast router state (IGMP/MLD queriers, PIM neighbor state) across multihomed PEs.
  * Introduces the Multicast Router Discovery (MRD) route type, a new sub-TLV in the BGP Tunnel Encapsulation Attribute for PIM Hello options, and uses EVPN Route Types 7 and 8 for PIM Join/Prune synchronization.
  * Covers three main use cases: multihomed external queriers in IGMP/MLD proxy EVPN Broadcast Domains, L3 multihoming with connected PIM routers, and OISM with connected PIM routers.

